<mxfile host="phase-trace-docs">
    <diagram id="export-dfd" name="1 · Two logs, two exits">
        <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1800" pageHeight="940" math="0" shadow="0" adaptiveColors="auto">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="title" value="Export topology — two logs kept deliberately apart" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="14" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="sub" value="MatchState maintains two parallel streams from the same committed chains. One is the validated momentum shape and nothing may be added to it casually; the other is the rich analysis shape where every field is optional." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="44" width="1600" height="24" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="zs" value="IN MEMORY — MatchState" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#808080;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="440" height="630" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="zw" value="WRITE PATH" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#808080;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="520" y="110" width="420" height="630" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="zf" value="ON DISK" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#808080;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="980" y="110" width="360" height="630" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="zr" value="READ PATH" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#808080;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1380" y="110" width="380" height="630" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="m_events" value="&lt;b&gt;events[]&lt;/b&gt;  —  the momentum shape&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;phase_sequence — one per sub-chain, a whole&#xa;possession collapsed into metres, field position&#xa;and linebreaks&#xa;try · penalty_try · penalty_kick · drop_goal&#xa;conversion · conversion_missed&#xa;turnover_won · penalty_won · sin_bin · red_card&#xa;&#xa;Written by events.chain_to_events()" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="70" y="170" width="380" height="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="m_actions" value="&lt;b&gt;actions[]&lt;/b&gt;  —  the analysis shape&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;carry · pass · kick — ONE ROW PER SEGMENT,&#xa;with start and end coordinates in metres&#xa;set_piece — scrum / lineout, won or lost, inferred&#xa;from who fed the ball versus who came away with it&#xa;error — knock_on / forward_pass / handling&#xa;&#xa;Written by events.chain_to_actions() and by the&#xa;tap handlers in MatchState" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="70" y="380" width="380" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="m_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Why two&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Nothing added to the rich stream can break the&#xa;validated momentum path. raw_export.action_stream()&#xa;merges them for the CSV bundle and drops&#xa;phase_sequence when it does, so the carries inside a&#xa;possession are not counted twice against their own bundle." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;dashed=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="70" y="605" width="380" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="w_val" value="&lt;b&gt;validate.py&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Not a schema copy — it runs the REAL pipeline:&#xa;RugbySport().translate(events)&#xa;MomentumEngine(...).compute(...)&#xa;&#xa;Any exception becomes a human-readable blocker&#xa;and the write does not happen. Nothing can KeyError&#xa;downstream that did not already fail here." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="550" y="170" width="360" height="150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="w_exp" value="&lt;b&gt;export.py&lt;/b&gt; — build_payload()&#xa;sorts by minute, wraps in teams / title / footer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="550" y="350" width="360" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="w_raw" value="&lt;b&gt;raw_export.py&lt;/b&gt; — export_raw()&#xa;action_stream() merge and sort by minute&#xa;player_rows() per (team, jersey)&#xa;team_summary() per-team scalars and breakdowns&#xa;position_rows() everything with a coordinate&#xa;&#xa;No validation: a column is simply blank where&#xa;nothing was tagged, which is the point." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="550" y="470" width="360" height="160" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="f_json" value="&lt;b&gt;events JSON&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;{ teams, title, footer, events[] }&#xa;&#xa;examples/tracer-sample.json is a real&#xa;tracer export, so it doubles as proof&#xa;that what the tracer writes is what&#xa;momentum.py can read." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;size=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1010" y="180" width="300" height="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="f_bundle" value="&lt;b&gt;exports/&amp;lt;HOME&amp;gt;_v_&amp;lt;AWAY&amp;gt;/&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━&#xa;match.json&#xa;   meta + actions + summary,&#xa;   self-contained source of truth&#xa;actions.csv&#xa;   one row per action and per event&#xa;players.csv&#xa;   per-jersey totals&#xa;team.csv&#xa;   per-team scalars&#xa;positions.csv&#xa;   one row per located thing" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;size=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1010" y="400" width="300" height="280" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r_mom" value="&lt;b&gt;momentum.py&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;CustomJSONSource.parse()&#xa;→ RugbySport.translate()&#xa;→ MomentumEngine.compute()&#xa;→ chart.render()&#xa;&#xa;The authoritative curve. origin_factor,&#xa;territory weighting and the sport's decay&#xa;half-life all apply." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1410" y="180" width="320" height="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r_report" value="&lt;b&gt;report/index.html&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;ingest.js reads match.json first and&#xa;falls back to the CSVs. All client-side.&#xa;&#xa;Pitch map · Heatmap · Team · Players&#xa;· Momentum&#xa;&#xa;⚠ The viewer's momentum is REBUILT&#xa;(report/momentum.js): possessions are&#xa;regrouped from consecutive same-team&#xa;actions and origin_factor is pinned to&#xa;1.0, because start_reason is not in&#xa;the CSV export. It approximates the&#xa;curve above; it does not reproduce it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1410" y="400" width="320" height="280" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fold" value="&lt;b&gt;One orientation for the whole match&lt;/b&gt;   Swapping ends at half-time is a 180° rotation of the pitch about its centre, so geometry.canonical_xy() folds every exported coordinate back into the first-half frame:  (x, y) → (100 − x, 70 − y).&#xa;Without it a team's heatmap would split across both ends of the pitch. Metre-based fields (metres_gained, end_metres_from_line) are already orientation-independent because they read attack_dir, so only x/y need folding — and attack_dir itself is reported in the canonical sense.&#xa;MatchState.canon_attack_dir_home records the frame the match began in; _flipped() is simply &quot;does the live direction still match it&quot;. Sessions saved before this existed default canon to their current direction, so nothing is spuriously folded on resume." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;dashed=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="780" width="1720" height="110" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="m_events" target="w_val">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e2" value="no errors" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="w_val" target="w_exp">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="w_exp" target="f_json">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f_json" target="r_mom">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="m_actions" target="w_raw">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e6" value="discretes only —&#xa;phase_sequence dropped" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="m_events" target="w_raw">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="w_raw" target="f_bundle">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f_bundle" target="r_report">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
    <diagram id="export-schema" name="2 · Record shapes">
        <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0" adaptiveColors="auto">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="stitle" value="Record shapes — what actually lands in each stream" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="14" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ssub" value="Fields marked ? are optional and simply absent when nothing was tagged — every reader tolerates that. Nothing here carries a momentum weight: the tracer records what happened, the translator decides what it is worth." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="44" width="1600" height="24" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r1" value="&lt;b&gt;phase_sequence&lt;/b&gt;   →  events[]&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;type                    &quot;phase_sequence&quot;&#xa;team                    display name&#xa;minute                  float&#xa;metres_gained           net forward, clamped ≥ 0&#xa;end_metres_from_line    0 … 100&#xa;linebreaks              int&#xa;start_metres_from_line  ?  first sub-chain only&#xa;start_reason            ?  first sub-chain only&#xa;players                 ?  [{number, role}]&#xa;&#xa;One per run of same-team segments. A kick or an&#xa;interception splits the chain, and each side of&#xa;the split becomes its own phase_sequence." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="110" width="500" height="330" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r2" value="&lt;b&gt;carry | pass | kick&lt;/b&gt;   →  actions[]&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;type                    &quot;carry&quot; | &quot;pass&quot; | &quot;kick&quot;&#xa;team, minute&#xa;metres_gained&#xa;end_metres_from_line&#xa;start_x_m, start_y_m    metres, first-half frame&#xa;end_x_m, end_y_m        metres, first-half frame&#xa;attack_dir              ±1, canonical sense&#xa;linebreak               ?  true only when set&#xa;intercepted             ?  true only when set&#xa;player                  ?  jersey number&#xa;start_reason            ?  first action of the chain&#xa;&#xa;One row per segment — the un-collapsed view of&#xa;the same play the phase_sequence bundles." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="600" y="110" width="500" height="330" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r3" value="&lt;b&gt;discrete events&lt;/b&gt;   →  events[]&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;type   try | penalty_try | penalty_kick |&#xa;       drop_goal | conversion |&#xa;       conversion_missed | turnover_won |&#xa;       penalty_won | sin_bin | red_card&#xa;team, minute&#xa;x_m, y_m       ?  where the ball was at the tap&#xa;label          ?  chart annotation&#xa;player, assist ?  set on an inferred try&#xa;conceded_by    ?  penalty_won: who gave it away&#xa;reason         ?  penalty_won: chooser pick&#xa;&#xa;Cards carry weight 0 — marker only, never fed&#xa;into the decay sum." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1140" y="110" width="500" height="330" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r4" value="&lt;b&gt;set_piece  and  error&lt;/b&gt;   →  actions[]&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;type      &quot;set_piece&quot;&#xa;kind      &quot;scrum&quot; | &quot;lineout&quot;&#xa;team      the FEEDING side&#xa;outcome   &quot;won&quot; | &quot;lost&quot;&#xa;minute, x_m, y_m&#xa;&#xa;type      &quot;error&quot;&#xa;kind      knock_on | forward_pass | handling&#xa;team, minute, x_m, y_m&#xa;&#xa;A set piece's outcome is inferred, not tapped: the&#xa;awarded side fed it, the side that started the next&#xa;possession came away with it. Same team = won." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="480" width="500" height="330" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r5" value="&lt;b&gt;positions.csv row&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;minute, type, team, conceded_by&#xa;x_m, y_m           the point&#xa;end_x_m, end_y_m   ?  kept so a line can be drawn&#xa;kind, outcome, reason, label&#xa;&#xa;Projects everything that has a position down to one&#xa;point per row: a traced action uses its start, a&#xa;discrete event its own stamped coordinate. Anything&#xa;without a position is skipped.&#xa;&#xa;A spreadsheet convenience — the bundled report reads&#xa;positions off match.json's action stream instead." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="600" y="480" width="500" height="330" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="r6" value="&lt;b&gt;StandardEvent&lt;/b&gt;   core/schema.py&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;team      str&#xa;t         float — continuous clock position&#xa;weight    float — threat energy&#xa;category  &quot;pressure&quot; | &quot;score&quot; | &quot;card&quot; | …&#xa;label     ? chart annotation&#xa;marker    ? &quot;score&quot; | &quot;note&quot; | None&#xa;&#xa;The only shape the maths ever sees. A phase_sequence&#xa;becomes one of these via _territory_weight():&#xa;&#xa;  base       = 0.15 + 0.35 · min(metres/40, 1)&#xa;  territory  = max(0, 1 − end_m_from_line/100)&#xa;  weight     = (base + 0.3·territory)&#xa;               × (1 + 0.25·linebreaks)&#xa;               × origin_factor[start_reason]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1140" y="480" width="500" height="330" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e_r1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r3" target="r6" value="translate()">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>
